{
  "photo-server": [
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "ingest",
      "description": "统一入库工具 — 自动判断路径类型和内容类型\n\n参数:\n- path: 必填，文件路径或目录路径\n- mode: copy（复制）| move（移动）| reference（引用），默认 copy\n- category: 分类，不传则自动推断\n- l1: L1 摘要（文档入库第二轮调用时传入）\n- file_path: 文档存储路径（L1 回传时使用）\n\n自动判断逻辑:\n1. 路径类型：is_dir() → 目录模式，is_file() → 文件模式\n2. 内容类型（文件）：按扩展名判断 — 照片(.jpg/.png等) → 照片流程，其他 → 文档流程\n3. 内容类型（目录）：扫描目录 — 全照片 → 批量照片，全文档 → 批量文档，混合 → 分别处理\n\n照片流程: EXIF → 人脸检测 → 人物匹配 → L0摘要 → KG同步\n文档流程: 拷贝 → 返回 need_l1 → 子Agent生成L1 → 调用 ingest(file_path=..., l1=...) 存储\n\n返回:\n- 照片: {status, photo_id, detected_persons, abstract, exif, kg_sync}\n- 文档(首轮): {status: \"need_l1\", file_path, content, hint}\n- 文档(L1回传): {status: \"success\", file_path}\n- 目录: {status, total, success/need_l1, results/files}",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "文件路径或目录路径"
          },
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "copy",
              "move",
              "reference"
            ],
            "default": "copy",
            "description": "文件操作模式"
          },
          "category": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "分类，不传则自动推断"
          },
          "l1": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "L1 摘要（文档入库第二轮调用时传入）"
          },
          "file_path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "文档存储路径（L1 回传时使用）"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "path"
        ]
      },
      "visibility": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "name_person",
      "description": "为人物命名\n\n参数:\n- person_id: 必填，人物ID\n- name: 必填，新名称\n\n返回:\n- status: success | error\n- person_id: 人物ID\n- name: 新名称\n- auto_label: 自动标签（如\"未命名人物_1\"）",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "person_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "人物ID"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "新名称"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "person_id",
          "name"
        ]
      },
      "visibility": "dynamic"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "merge_persons",
      "description": "合并两个人物\n\n参数:\n- person_a_id: 必填，保留的人物ID\n- person_b_id: 必填，要合并到A的人物ID\n\n返回:\n- status: success | error\n- merged_into: 合并到的人物ID\n- name: 保留的名称\n- photo_count: 合并后的照片数量\n- deleted_person_id: 被删除的人物ID\n\n说明:\n- 保留 person_a 的名称\n- 合并所有人脸向量，重新计算中心\n- 更新所有照片关联\n- 学习机制：如果相似度低于阈值，自动调整阈值",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "person_a_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "保留的人物ID"
          },
          "person_b_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "要合并的人物ID"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "person_a_id",
          "person_b_id"
        ]
      },
      "visibility": "dynamic"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "search_persons",
      "description": "搜索人物（按名字模糊匹配）\n\n参数:\n- query: 搜索词（人名，子串匹配）\n- limit: 返回数量（默认10）\n\n返回:\n- 匹配的人物列表",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "搜索词（人名）"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "返回数量",
            "default": 10
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "query"
        ]
      },
      "visibility": "dynamic"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "get_unnamed_persons",
      "description": "获取所有未命名人物\n\n返回:\n- 未命名人物列表，按出现次数排序\n- 包含：id, auto_label, photo_count, has_valid_photos, photos: [{file_path, boxed_path}]\n- boxed_path 是带人脸红框的图片路径，前端用 ::person_photo:: 标记显示\n- has_valid_photos=false 表示该人物的照片文件已不存在",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {}
      },
      "visibility": "dynamic"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "delete_person",
      "description": "删除人物及其所有关联数据\n\n警告：这会删除人物图谱中的节点，请谨慎使用。\n只有在用户明确要求删除时才调用。\n\n参数:\n- person_id: 要删除的人物ID\n\n返回:\n- status: success | error\n- message: 结果说明",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "person_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "人物ID"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "person_id"
        ]
      },
      "visibility": "dynamic"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "cleanup_deleted_photos",
      "description": "清理已删除照片的数据库记录\n\n在删除照片文件/目录后调用，清理数据库中的孤儿记录。\n扫描 photos 表，删除文件不存在的记录及其关联的 faces 记录。\n\n返回:\n- deleted_photos: 删除的照片记录数\n- deleted_faces: 删除的人脸记录数\n\n使用场景：\n- 用户删除了照片目录后\n- 清理数据库中的残留记录",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {}
      },
      "visibility": "dynamic"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "get_person_photos",
      "description": "获取某人物的多张照片（用于\"换一张\"场景）\n\n当用户说\"看不清\"、\"换一张\"时调用此工具。\n\n参数:\n- person_id: 人物ID\n- limit: 最多返回几张照片（默认5）\n\n返回:\n- person_id, person_name\n- photos: [{file_path, boxed_path, taken_at}, ...]\n\nboxed_path 是带人脸红框的图片路径，前端用 ::person_photo:: 标记显示。",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "person_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "人物ID"
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "最多返回几张（默认5）"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "person_id"
        ]
      },
      "visibility": "dynamic"
    },
    {
      "server": "photo-server",
      "name": "unload_face_model",
      "description": "卸载人脸识别模型，释放内存（约 326MB）\n\n在长时间空闲时调用此工具释放内存。\n通常由系统在 SLEEP 状态时自动调用。\n\n返回:\n- status: success\n- message: 卸载结果",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {}
      },
      "visibility": "hidden"
    }
  ],
