  "scheduler-server": [
    {
      "server": "scheduler-server",
      "name": "schedule_task",
      "description": "创建定时任务，支持单次和循环任务。\n\n参数：\n- content (必填): 任务内容，如 \"开会\"、\"吃药\"\n- scheduled_at (必填): 首次触发时间，ISO格式，如 \"2026-04-06T08:00:00\"\n- event_type (可选): 事件类型，meeting/task/reminder/recurring，默认 reminder\n- is_recurring (可选): 是否循环任务，默认 false\n- cron_expr (可选): cron 表达式（循环任务必填），如 \"0 8 * * *\"（每天8点）\n\n示例：\n1. 单次提醒：content=\"开会\", scheduled_at=\"2026-04-07T15:00:00\", event_type=\"meeting\"\n2. 每天提醒：content=\"吃药\", scheduled_at=\"2026-04-06T08:00:00\", is_recurring=true, cron_expr=\"0 8 * * *\"\n\n重要：相对时间（明天、下周）必须由 Agent 转换为具体的日期时间。",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "content": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务内容"
          },
          "scheduled_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "首次触发时间（ISO格式）"
          },
          "event_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "meeting",
              "task",
              "reminder",
              "recurring"
            ]
          },
          "is_recurring": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否循环任务"
          },
          "cron_expr": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "cron 表达式"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "content",
          "scheduled_at"
        ]
      },
      "visibility": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "server": "scheduler-server",
      "name": "list_scheduled_tasks",
      "description": "查询定时任务列表。\n\n参数：\n- status (可选): 筛选状态，pending/triggered/cancelled\n\n返回：任务列表，包含 id、content、scheduled_at、is_recurring、cron_expr、status",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "triggered",
              "cancelled"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "visibility": "static"
    },
